{"ref":"BDB, רָזוֹן","hw":"רָזוֹן","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָזוֹן</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>leanness, wasting, scantness</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span>:<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>leanness</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.16\">Is 10:16</a> (fig.; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁמַנָּיו</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>wasting</em>, i.e. wasting disease, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:15\" href=\"/Psalms.106.15\">ψ 106:15</a> (cf. Bae).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיפַת ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:10\" href=\"/Micah.6.10\">Mi 6:10</a> <em>ephah of scantness</em>, scant measure.—ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָזוֹן</span> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, רָזַן\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_רָזַן\">רזן</a>.","next":"BDB, רזח","prev":"BDB, רָזִי"}